            "review_title": "Review at Ben Thanh Café & Beer",
            "review_text": "Daniel T\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat place to chill in ho chi minh\nOct 2016 • Friends\nBen thanh cafe is the most chilled cafe in ho chi minh I have been so far. Great atmosphere, super affordable, best view ever especially during the night. Great view of Ben thanh area. Nice and friendly staffs. If anyone were to go Ben thanh and would like to find a nice place to chill with great views, I would strongly recommend you guys to this cafe. They serve delicious food, nice drinks and beers.\nRead more\nWritten October 10, 2016",
